{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_01",
      "hash": "89318c21a2f32408",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Welcome to 枯葉道館！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_07",
      "hash": "89319221a2f32e3a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hi！Baby！\\nYou就是challenger嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_08",
      "hash": "89318521a2f31823",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哈哈～！\\n就憑you那一點點的power，\\c\\n竟然也敢來挑戰me，\\n膽子還真大呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_09",
      "hash": "89318421a2f31670",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "寶可夢對戰\\n可沒有那麼簡單呦～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_10",
      "hash": "892e0721a2f00c32",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Me會把你們全都\\n電得麻～麻滴！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_03_07",
      "hash": "47fdc3356398ac8b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_02",
      "hash": "89318f21a2f32921",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "OK！\\n橙色徽章就給you了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8020_sys_01",
      "hash": "cbbdb782c305534c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從馬志士那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]橙色徽章[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_03",
      "hash": "89318e21a2f3276e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "And！\\c\\n這是me的一點心意，\\n送給擁有special實力的you！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8020_sys_02",
      "hash": "cbbdba82c3055865",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從馬志士那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]馬志士的簽名[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_04",
      "hash": "89319121a2f32c87",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "………………"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_11",
      "hash": "892e0821a2f00de5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哈哈哈！Don't worry！\\n這個當然也會送給you！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main8020_sys_03",
      "hash": "cbbdb982c30556b2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從馬志士那裡\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]\\r\\n「[VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)]」！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_05",
      "hash": "89319021a2f32ad4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器36是\\n電力十足的「十萬伏特」！\\c\\n請拿去教electric的寶可夢吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main8020_volt_06",
      "hash": "89319321a2f32fed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hey！\\n還要給you一個小建議！\\c\\nElectric power\\n麻麻的很強力～！\\c\\n不過面對地面屬性時，\\nPower會被吸收走，\\r\\n完全useless喔～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_03_06",
      "hash": "47fdc2356398aad8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 15]"
    }
  ],
